:: Bailey HQ Approach
<<effects>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<set $baileyHQ.alertness += 1>>
	<<passoutstreet>>
<<else>>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is bustling inside as trucks unload their cargo into the external loading dock, workers traipse around the warehouse and trucks occasionally go in and out of the garage. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned guard post stands watch.
	<<else>>
		You approach the sprawling warehouse complex surrounded by barbed wire fence. Activity is quiet inside, trucks are stationary at the external loading dock, the loading dock gates are closed and the garage door is closed. There is only one entrace in or out and a manned guard post stands watch.	
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Approach the guard post|Bailey HQ Guard Post]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Approach the barbed wire fence|Bailey HQ Barbed Wire Fence]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

